    "note": [
        {
            "structuredValue": [],
            "parallelValue": [],
            "groupedValue": [],
            "value": "This data repository contains the code used to calculate mean values of d13C and of soil respiration and to perform sensitivity tests on the analysis. To calculate soil respiration requires the installation of two packages (\"soilresp\" and \"CRGfunc\"), both of which are included in this data repository. Additionally included is the .csv file which contains the compilation of d13C data. The output of these R scripts are Figure 2 (main text) and DR Figures 3-9 (Data Repository).",
            "type": "abstract",
            "identifier": [],
            "note": [],
            "appliesTo": []
        },
